# Grabio POS (Windows)

## Read first
- `docs/planning/pos-windows-handoff.md` — structure + handoff
- `docs/planning/pos-sync-contract.md` — API contract

## Code locations
- POS app: `the eco sys/ecosystem-plan/posfinal-main/pos-v1/` (Electron + SQL.js)
- Platform API: `functions/src/api/posSync.ts`
- Admin UI: `src/pages/admin/PosPairing.tsx` → `/admin/pos`

## API base (prod)
`https://us-central1-market-flow-7b074.cloudfunctions.net/api`

## Live endpoints (api + Cloud Run)
- `POST /pos/pairing-code` — admin generates code (Bearer)
- `POST /pos/generate-install-token` — auto-pair token (Bearer)
- `POST /pos/auto-pair` — POS first-launch with pairing.json
- `POST /pos/pair` — POS exchanges code for deviceToken
- `POST /pos/heartbeat` — keepalive
- `GET /pos/catalog`, `POST /pos/orders` + sync routes — live

## Installer
`pos/Grabio-POS-Setup.exe` in Firebase Storage (public read). Admin: `/admin/pos`

## Rules
- POS stays offline-first; sync is additive, not a rewrite
- `composedProductSource` set at pair time: `platform` | `pos`
- No prod Firebase deploy without owner approval
- Credentials only in `.credentials.md` (gitignored)
